license: GPL-2.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/mtrik/golden-dashboard"
url: "https://github.com/mtrik/golden-dashboard"
abstract: >
  Golden Dashboard is a WordPress plugin providing Elementor widgets for a
  front-end user wallet dashboard, supporting both a standard cash wallet
  and a gold-denominated wallet, with an accompanying admin panel for
  transaction management, cashback rules, withdrawal requests, and
  security settings.
